          "description": "Enables or disables this ticket source; when disabled, Bakery stops observing and syncing its external container until it is re-enabled. Enabling a disabled source whose automatic admission is on restamps automatic.since to the server clock and advances the policy revision, so an issue labeled while the source was off waits for adoption. That re-enable also re-checks the delegation principal, so a request must replace a delegation whose principal has left the organization or it answers 422 delegation_principal_unknown.",
